"""CWE-mapped local heuristic signatures for COMMENT GEN PRO.

A signature match is a review lead, not proof of exploitability. The scanner
never executes submitted code. Many added signatures require source and sink
tokens on the same line and therefore do not perform interprocedural taint
analysis.
"""
